#: .\frontend\mockdata\collections.py:24
msgid "Thrown, trimmed and fired one at a time."
msgstr "逐件拉坯、修整与烧制。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\collections.py:25
msgid ""
"Stoneware and porcelain for the table, made in a Jingdezhen studio where "
"the clay is quarried an hour away and the glazes are mixed from ash and "
"iron. Expect small variations in colour and rim -- they are the record of a "
"hand, not a fault."
msgstr "为餐桌而作的炻器与瓷器，来自景德镇的一间工作室。泥料取自一小时车程外，釉料则由灰烬与铁调配而成。颜色与器口会有细微差异，那是手作留下的痕迹，而非瑕疵。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\collections.py:35
msgid "Woven, dyed and washed until they soften."
msgstr "经编织、染色与水洗，直至柔软。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\collections.py:36
msgid ""
"Linen and handwoven cotton, dyed with indigo grown in Yunnan and finished "
"so that nothing arrives stiff. These are pieces meant to be used daily and "
"washed often."
msgstr "亚麻与手织棉布，以云南种植的蓝靛染色，并经过处理，不会以僵硬的状态抵达。适合每日使用，也经得起频繁清洗。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\collections.py:45
msgid "Objects for the quieter corners of a room."
msgstr "为房间里安静的角落而作。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\collections.py:46
msgid ""
"Candles poured in batches of forty, boards cut from reclaimed courtyard "
"beams, brass that is meant to darken. Small things that change the feeling "
"of a room more than their size suggests."
msgstr "蜡烛每批浇注四十支，木板取自回收的庭院梁木，黄铜则有意让它逐渐变深。这些小物件虽不大，却比尺寸所暗示的更能改变房间的气息。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\collections.py:55
msgid "Wrapped in unbleached paper and cotton string."
msgstr "以本色纸与棉绳包裹。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\collections.py:56
msgid ""
"Pieces that travel well as a gift, boxed by hand with a card you can write "
"at checkout. Nothing here is sealed in plastic."
msgstr "适合作为礼物寄送的作品，手工装盒，并附有可在结算时书写的卡片。这里的任何东西都不会以塑料密封。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\collections.py:63
msgid "The Earth Collection"
msgstr "大地系列"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\collections.py:64
msgid "Ash, clay, indigo and unbleached linen."
msgstr "灰烬、泥土、蓝靛与本色亚麻。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\collections.py:65
msgid ""
"Nine pieces built from the same short list of materials, glazed and dyed "
"with what our makers can source within a day's drive of their own studios. "
"Put together, they sit in a single tonal range -- bone, ash, clay and a "
"green that comes from grass rather than a pigment jar."
msgstr "九件作品取自同一份精简的材料清单，以匠人工作室一日车程内能够找到的材料上釉与染色。组合在一起，它们呈现出骨白、灰烬、泥土与草色组成的统一色调。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\collections.py:80
msgid "Quiet Mornings"
msgstr "静谧清晨"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\collections.py:81
msgid "For the first hour of the day."
msgstr "献给一天开始的第一个小时。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\collections.py:82
msgid ""
"Cups, drippers and a candle for the part of the morning before anything has "
"been asked of you. Chosen so the pieces sit together on a small table."
msgstr "杯子、手冲壶与一支蜡烛，属于清晨尚未向你提出任何要求的那段时间。我们挑选它们，让这些作品在一张小桌上自然相称。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\collections.py:89
msgid "Studio Essentials"
msgstr "工作室日用"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\collections.py:90
msgid "The pieces we use ourselves."
msgstr "我们自己每天使用的作品。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\collections.py:91
msgid ""
"What is actually in daily use in the studio: an apron that has been washed "
"a hundred times, boards that get cut on, towels that get used."
msgstr "工作室真正用于日常的物件：洗过一百次的围裙、反复切割使用的木板，以及每天都会用到的毛巾。"

