#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\search\results.html:67
msgid "Makers"
msgstr "匠人"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:51
msgid "Materials"
msgstr "材质"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:54
msgid "Help"
msgstr "帮助"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:55 .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:134
msgid "Shipping"
msgstr "配送"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:56 .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:153
#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\pages\legal.html:33
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "退货"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:57 .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:172
msgid "Care Guide"
msgstr "保养指南"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:58
#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\checkout.html:31
#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\pages\contact.html:7
#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\partials\mobile_nav.html:13
msgid "Contact"
msgstr "联系"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:59
#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\pages\faq.html:7
msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:60
msgid "Image Credits"
msgstr "图片来源"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:65
msgid "Designed"
msgstr "设计"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:66
msgid ""
"Each piece begins with an idea, a sketch or -- more often -- a material that "
"turned up and suggested something. Nothing goes into production until the "
"maker has lived with a sample for a season."
msgstr ""
"每件作品都始于一个念头、一张草图，或者更常见的——一块偶然遇见、自己提出想法的"
"材料。在匠人与样品共处一季之前，任何东西都不会投入制作。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:70
msgid "Crafted"
msgstr "制作"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:71
msgid ""
"Made individually, on a wheel, a loom or a bench. A mug takes about forty "
"minutes to throw and trim; a throw takes the better part of three days on "
"the loom. There is no version of this that is faster."
msgstr ""
"在拉坯机、织机或工作台上逐件完成。一只杯子拉坯与修坯约需四十分钟；一条盖毯要"
"在织机上花去将近三天。这件事没有更快的做法。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:75
msgid "Finished"
msgstr "刚刚完成"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:76
msgid ""
"Checked by hand, wrapped in unbleached paper, and packed with a card naming "
"the person who made it. Anything that does not pass goes back to the studio "
"shelf, not into a box."
msgstr ""
"逐件手工检查，以本色纸包裹，并附上写有制作者姓名的卡片。未通过检查的作品会回"
"到工作室的架子上，而不是装进箱子。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:83 .\frontend\templates\frontend\home.html:16
msgid "Our story"
msgstr "品牌故事"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:84
msgid "Made by hand, meant to be kept."
msgstr "手工制成，值得长久留用。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:85
msgid ""
"Atelier Form began in 2019 with one kiln, one loom and a stubborn conviction "
"that the objects people use every day deserve more attention than they "
"usually get."
msgstr ""
"Atelier Form 始于 2019 年，起点是一座窑、一台织机，以及一个固执的信念：人们日"
"常使用的器物，值得比通常得到的更多用心。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:89
msgid "How it started"
msgstr "制作过程"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:91
msgid ""
"We started by buying a single firing from a ceramicist in Jingdezhen who was "
"about to close her studio because wholesale prices had fallen below what the "
"clay cost her. That firing sold out in nine days. She is still with us, and "
"she now works with two apprentices."
msgstr ""
"我们的开始，是向景德镇一位陶艺师买下一整窑作品——当时批发价已低于她的泥料成"
"本，工作室濒临关门。那一窑在九天内售罄。她至今仍与我们合作，如今还带着两名学"
"徒。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:95
msgid ""
"That set the shape of everything since. We do not commission from factories "
"or buy from agents. We work with five makers, we know what each of them can "
"produce in a month, and we build the range around that rather than the other "
"way round."
msgstr ""
"此后的一切都由此定形。我们不向工厂下单，也不从中间商采购。我们与五位匠人合"
"作，清楚每个人一个月能做多少，再据此安排产品线，而不是反过来。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:100
msgid "The materials we use"
msgstr "我们使用的材料"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:102
msgid ""
"Stoneware and porcelain from clay quarried within an hour of the studio that "
"throws it. Flax linen from a single European mill. Cotton spun in Yunnan and "
"dyed with indigo grown in the same valley. Timber reclaimed from Huizhou "
"houses under restoration."
msgstr ""
"炻器与瓷器所用的泥料，采自距拉坯工作室一小时车程之内。亚麻来自欧洲的一家纺"
"厂。棉纱在云南纺成，并以同一山谷种植的蓝靛染色。木料取自正在修缮的徽州老宅。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:106
msgid ""
"The list is short on purpose. A short list means we can actually answer the "
"question of where something came from, and it means the range holds together "
"tonally without anyone having to art-direct it."
msgstr ""
"这份清单刻意保持简短。清单短，我们才真的答得出每样东西来自哪里；也正因如此，"
"整个系列在色调上自然成立，无需刻意的视觉统筹。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:110
msgid "Why small batches"
msgstr "为何坚持小批量"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:112
msgid ""
"We make roughly four hundred pieces a month across every category. That "
"number has not changed much in three years, and we are not trying to change "
"it."
msgstr ""
"我们各品类每月合计制作约四百件。这个数字三年来变化不大，我们也无意改变它。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:114
msgid ""
"Volume would mean standardising the glazes, mechanising the finishing, and "
"moving to a schedule the makers do not set. The pieces would survive that. "
"The reason people like them would not."
msgstr ""
"扩大产量意味着釉色标准化、修整机械化，以及采用并非由匠人决定的排期。作品或许"
"还能存续，但人们喜欢它们的理由会消失。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:117
msgid ""
"The trade-off is real and we would rather state it plainly: things sell out, "
"restocks take weeks, and made-to-order means made to order."
msgstr ""
"这个取舍是真实的，我们宁愿直说：东西会售罄，补货要等上数周，而订制就是真的现"
"做。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:122
msgid "makers, all known by name"
msgstr "五位匠人，每一位我们都叫得出名字。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:123
msgid "pieces made each month"
msgstr "每月制成的件数"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:124
msgid "the year of the first firing"
msgstr "第一次烧窑的年份"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:125
msgid "pieces made in a factory"
msgstr "由工厂制造的件数"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:130
msgid "Shipping & Returns"
msgstr "配送与退货"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:131
msgid ""
"Everything is packed by hand in the studio. Here is exactly what that means "
"for timings, costs and sending something back."
msgstr ""
"所有商品均在工作室手工打包。以下说明这在时效、费用与退货方面究竟意味着什么。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:135
msgid ""
"In-stock orders are dispatched within 2–4 working days. Made-to-order pieces "
"carry their own lead time, stated clearly on the product page before you buy."
msgstr ""
"现货订单在 2–4 个工作日内发出。订制作品有各自的制作周期，购买前会在商品页面明"
"确标注。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:137
msgid ""
"Standard delivery is ¥8 and takes 3–6 working days domestically. It is "
"complimentary on orders above ¥80. Express delivery is ¥18 and dispatches "
"the next working day where stock allows."
msgstr ""
"标准配送费用为 ¥8，国内需 3–6 个工作日。订单满 ¥80 免运费。加急配送为 ¥18，在"
"有货情况下次个工作日发出。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:140
msgid ""
"International delivery is available to most countries at cost, calculated at "
"checkout. Duties and import taxes are not included and are payable by the "
"recipient on arrival."
msgstr ""
"我们按成本价寄送至大多数国家，运费在结算时计算。价格不含关税与进口税，由收件"
"人在货物到达时承担。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:143
msgid ""
"If an order contains both in-stock and made-to-order pieces, we ship them "
"separately as they are ready and charge delivery only once."
msgstr ""
"若一笔订单同时包含现货与订制作品，我们会在各自备妥后分别寄出，运费只收一次。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:146
msgid "Packaging"
msgstr "包装"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:147
msgid ""
"Ceramics travel wrapped in recycled tissue inside moulded pulp, in a double-"
"walled box. We do not use plastic film, bubble wrap or polystyrene anywhere "
"in the studio."
msgstr ""
"陶器以再生纸包裹，置于纸浆模塑中，再装入双层瓦楞纸箱。工作室的任何环节都不使"
"用塑料膜、气泡膜或泡沫塑料。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:150
msgid ""
"Textiles are folded, wrapped in unbleached paper and tied with cotton "
"string. The wrapping is the gift wrapping -- there is no upgrade to buy."
msgstr ""
"织物经折叠后以本色纸包裹，并以棉绳系好。这层包装本身就是礼品包装——无需另行付"
"费升级。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:154
msgid ""
"You have thirty days from delivery to return an unused piece in its original "
"packaging. Email the studio first and we will send you a return reference."
msgstr ""
"自收货起三十天内，未使用且保持原包装的作品可退。定制与订制作品仅在存在瑕疵时"
"可退。详见"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:156
msgid ""
"Refunds are issued to the original payment method within five working days "
"of the parcel reaching us. Return postage is ours if the piece is faulty or "
"not what you ordered, and yours for a change of mind."
msgstr ""
"包裹送达我们处后五个工作日内，退款将原路退回。若作品存在瑕疵或与所订不符，退"
"货运费由我们承担；若因个人改变主意，则由您承担。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:159
msgid ""
"Made-to-order and commissioned pieces can only be returned if faulty, since "
"they were made specifically for you. This is stated on the product page."
msgstr ""
"订制与定制作品因专为您制作，仅在存在瑕疵时可退。商品页面对此有明确说明。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:162
msgid "If something arrives broken"
msgstr "如果收到时有破损"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:163
msgid ""
"Send a photograph within 48 hours and we will replace the piece or refund "
"you in full, whichever you prefer. You do not need to send the damaged piece "
"back."
msgstr ""
"请在 48 小时内拍照发给我们，我们将按您的意愿补发或全额退款。破损的作品无需寄"
"回。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:165
msgid ""
"This happens on roughly one order in two hundred. We would rather you told "
"us than lived with it."
msgstr "这种情况约每两百单发生一次。比起您将就着用，我们更希望您告诉我们。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:173
msgid ""
"Handmade pieces are more robust than most people expect. Nearly all of what "
"shortens their life is heat, sunlight or impatience."
msgstr ""
"手作器物比多数人想象的更结实。真正缩短它们寿命的，几乎都是高温、日晒与急躁。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:177
msgid "High-fired stoneware and porcelain, fully vitrified."
msgstr "高温烧制的炻器与瓷器，完全瓷化。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:179
msgid ""
"Dishwasher safe. Hand washing keeps a matte glaze looking newer for longer, "
"but the machine will not damage the piece."
msgstr "可用洗碗机清洗。手洗能让哑光釉面更久保持如新，但机洗不会损坏作品。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:181
msgid ""
"Avoid thermal shock. Let a hot piece cool before rinsing, and never move a "
"cold piece straight into a hot oven."
msgstr ""
"避免骤冷骤热。刚加热过的器物请先放凉再冲洗，也不要将冷的器物直接放入已预热的"
"烤箱。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:183
msgid ""
"Not suitable for direct flame or the microwave if the piece has any metallic "
"detail. None of ours currently do."
msgstr ""
"不可直接明火加热；若器物带有金属装饰，则不可微波。我们目前的作品均无金属装"
"饰。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:185
msgid ""
"Unglazed feet may mark the table over time. A damp cloth with a little "
"bicarbonate lifts most marks."
msgstr ""
"未施釉的底足日久可能在桌面留下痕迹。用湿布蘸少量小苏打即可去除大部分痕迹。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:187
msgid ""
"Fine crazing in the glaze is cosmetic on a vitrified body and does not "
"affect strength or water-tightness."
msgstr "瓷化胎体上的细微开片属于外观特征，不影响强度与密封性。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:191
msgid "Washed linen and handwoven, naturally dyed cotton."
msgstr "水洗亚麻，以及手织的天然染色棉布。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:193
msgid ""
"Cool machine wash, gentle cycle, mild detergent. No fabric softener -- it "
"coats the fibre and stops linen softening naturally."
msgstr ""
"冷水机洗，轻柔模式，使用温和洗涤剂。请勿使用柔顺剂——它会包覆纤维，妨碍亚麻自"
"然变软。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:195
msgid ""
"Line dry in shade. Direct sun will lift natural indigo faster than anything "
"else you can do to it."
msgstr "阴凉处晾干。相比其他任何因素，阳光直射都会更快使天然蓝靛褪色。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:197
msgid ""
"Wash naturally dyed pieces separately for the first two or three washes."
msgstr "天然染色的织物，前两三次请单独清洗。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:198
msgid ""
"Warm iron while slightly damp if you want a crisper finish. Most pieces are "
"designed to be left alone."
msgstr ""
"若想要更挺括的效果，可在略带潮气时以温熨斗熨烫。不过多数作品本就无需打理。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:200
msgid ""
"Linen strengthens when wet, so it handles washing better than it looks like "
"it should. It genuinely improves for the first fifty washes."
msgstr "亚麻遇水会更结实，因此比看上去更耐洗。前五十次水洗，它确实会越用越好。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:203
msgid "Candles"
msgstr "蜡烛"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:204
msgid "Soy and rapeseed wax, cotton wick."
msgstr "大豆蜡与菜籽蜡，棉质烛芯。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:206
msgid ""
"Let the first burn run two to three hours, until the melt pool reaches the "
"edge. Wax has a memory and the first burn sets the pattern."
msgstr ""
"第一次点燃请持续两到三小时，直至烛池扩至边缘。蜡是有记忆的，第一次燃烧决定了"
"此后的形态。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:208
msgid ""
"Trim the wick to about 5 mm before every burn. This is the single thing that "
"most affects how cleanly a candle burns."
msgstr ""
"每次点燃前将烛芯修剪至约 5 毫米。这是影响蜡烛燃烧是否洁净的最关键一点。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:210
msgid ""
"Never burn for more than four hours at a time, and never leave one "
"unattended."
msgstr "单次燃烧请勿超过四小时，也切勿在无人看管时点燃。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:211
msgid ""
"Stop burning when about 10 mm of wax remains, then wash the vessel in warm "
"water and keep it."
msgstr "当剩余蜡体约 10 毫米时请停止使用，用温水洗净容器后留作他用。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:214
msgid "Wood & brass"
msgstr "木料与黄铜"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:215
msgid "Reclaimed hardwood, oak and unlacquered brass."
msgstr "再生硬木、橡木与未涂漆黄铜。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:217
msgid ""
"Hand wash wood in warm water and dry immediately. Never put a board in the "
"dishwasher or leave it soaking."
msgstr "木器请以温水手洗并立即擦干。切勿放入洗碗机，也不要长时间浸泡。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:219
msgid ""
"Re-oil with food-safe linseed or mineral oil two or three times a year, or "
"whenever the surface looks dry."
msgstr "每年用食品级亚麻籽油或矿物油保养两到三次，或在表面显干时随时补涂。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:221
msgid "Unlacquered brass darkens with handling. That is the intended finish."
msgstr "未涂漆的黄铜会随着使用而变深。这正是我们想要的质感。"

#: .\frontend\mockdata\content.py:222
msgid ""
"If you want the shine back, lemon juice and bicarbonate will do it in a "
"minute. It will darken again, which is fine."
msgstr ""
"若想恢复光泽，用柠檬汁加小苏打一分钟即可。它之后还会再变深，这没有关系。"

