#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\pages\legal.html:20
msgid "What we collect"
msgstr "我们收集的信息"

#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\pages\legal.html:21
msgid ""
"Your name, email address, delivery address and phone number, so that an "
"order can be packed and sent. Payment details are handled by the payment "
"provider and never reach our servers."
msgstr ""
"您的姓名、邮箱、收货地址与电话，用于打包与寄送订单。支付信息由支付服务商处"
"理，绝不会进入我们的服务器。"

#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\pages\legal.html:22
msgid "How it is used"
msgstr "信息的用途"

#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\pages\legal.html:23
msgid ""
"To fulfil orders, answer questions about them, and — only if you asked for "
"it — to send the studio newsletter. We do not sell or share customer data "
"with advertisers."
msgstr ""
"用于履行订单、解答相关问题，以及在您主动订阅的前提下发送工作室通讯。我们不会"
"向广告商出售或共享客户数据。"

#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\pages\legal.html:24
msgid "What this prototype stores"
msgstr "本原型存储的内容"

#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\pages\legal.html:25
msgid ""
"The prototype database stores account details, saved addresses, server-side "
"bags, orders, newsletter subscriptions and contact messages. Signed-in "
"wishlists are stored with the account; guest wishlists and recently viewed "
"pieces remain in this browser."
msgstr ""
"原型数据库存储账户资料、已保存地址、服务端购物袋、订单、通讯订阅与联系留言。"
"登录后的心愿单随账户保存；访客心愿单与最近浏览记录仅保留在本浏览器中。"

#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\pages\legal.html:26
msgid "Your rights"
msgstr "您的权利"

#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\pages\legal.html:27
msgid ""
"You can ask for a copy of your data or ask for it to be deleted by emailing "
"the studio. Requests are answered within thirty days."
msgstr "您可致信工作室，索取您的数据副本或要求删除。我们将在三十天内答复。"

#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\pages\legal.html:29
msgid "Ordering"
msgstr "订单"

#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\pages\legal.html:30
msgid ""
"Placing an order is an offer to buy. A contract is formed when the studio "
"confirms dispatch. Prices are shown inclusive of applicable tax and "
"exclusive of any import duties, which are payable by the recipient."
msgstr ""
"下单即为购买要约。工作室确认发货时合同成立。标价含适用税费，不含进口关税，关"
"税由收件人承担。"

#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\pages\legal.html:31
msgid "Handmade variation"
msgstr "手作差异"

#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\pages\legal.html:32
msgid ""
"Every piece is made individually. Colour, glaze and dimensions vary within a "
"normal range, and that variation is not a defect. Product photography shows "
"a representative piece rather than the exact one you will receive."
msgstr ""
"每件作品均单独制作。颜色、釉面与尺寸在正常范围内会有差异，这并非瑕疵。商品照"
"片展示的是代表性样品，而非您将收到的那一件。"

#: .\frontend\templates\frontend\pages\legal.html:34
msgid ""
"Thirty days from delivery for unused pieces in their original packaging. "
"Made-to-order and commissioned pieces can only be returned if faulty. See the"
msgstr ""
"自收货起三十天内，未使用且保持原包装的作品可退。定制与订制作品仅在存在瑕疵时"
"可退。详见"

